            <title>0.3.25</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:46:10 +0300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>31</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.25</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Relay 0.3.25

- The recording toolbar stays visible while choosing a window or application.
- Clear guidance explains macOS's Share This Window step and when to click Record.
- Cancel or Escape restores usable controls; completing a selection shows its window/application name.
- Recording controls remain available on the current desktop after selection.
]]></description>
