        <item>
            <title>0.3.24</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:10:05 +0300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>30</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.24</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Relay 0.3.24

- Compact screen recording controls beside the existing screenshot tools. Screenshot remains the default, with Draw selected for markup.
- Record a screen, window, application, or selected area, including exact pixel coordinates.
- Optional click indicators, system audio, microphone, and compression choices.
- Pause and resume without keeping the paused time; Stop saves an MP4 to Desktop.

Screen recording requires macOS 15 or later. Existing screenshot and markup features remain available on macOS 14.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/justaicode/relay-updates/releases/download/v0.3.24/Relay-0.3.24-macOS.zip" length="4376204" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="5CCzQ4L3sU8A6aQeeblt5IMya/mbDHRiW97pYTHRr4b8wCbt03fxjJRddm3U6Fg8TvKOvOeAy6qwUSOzIXHIAg=="/>
